        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Right shoulder pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Insidious right anterolateral shoulder pain for approximately 3-4 months, extending to the lateral upper arm; worse with overhead activity, reaching into cupboards, and lying on the right side; wakes him. Difficulty lifting a kettle with the right arm. No neck pain or distal paraesthesia."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
