        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Right shoulder examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No gross deformity; slight reduction in supraspinatus bulk compared with the left; anterolateral tenderness just distal to the acromion; AC joint non-tender. Passive range of motion near full but painful from 80-120 degrees of abduction and forward flexion. Active abduction limited to approximately 90 degrees due to pain with possible weakness; painful arc present. Jobe test painful with mild weakness; external rotation against resistance painful with slight weakness; internal rotation (lift-off) near normal but uncomfortable."
      }
    },
